‚{"coworker": "Release Notes Writer", "question": "I've sent you the release notes for revision twice now to fix trailing whitespace, but the issue persists in every line ending with two spaces. Are you aware that two spaces at the end of a line in Markdown creates a line break, and that trailing whitespace (spaces at the end of a line not intended for line breaks) should be completely removed? Please confirm and send a version with all unintended trailing whitespace removed.", "context": "The release notes draft still contains trailing whitespace on multiple lines after two revision requests. The linter continues to flag lines with trailing spaces. The expected format requires no trailing whitespace unless used intentionally for line breaks, and even then, it should not cause linter warnings. Need to clarify the formatting expectations with the writer."}J,
